## Interface: 16001
## Title: TrinketQueue
## Notes: Your two trinket slots in a frame of their own, drawn like the character sheet's. A click or a key binding uses a trinket. The arrow above a slot lists the trinkets in your bags; the one you pick goes on as soon as you're out of combat, and a right-click on the slot drops it. Shift-drag to move.
